      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "- For this build we show the spider boss behavior. He will use cover to
    fight you, stepping out to shoot bubble gum wads at you. \n- You can also break
    the rock candy cover using the chomper (Green) or water gun (blue). Solid block
    cover can not be broken.\n- The spider will slowly repair the rock candy walls
    as it move back behind it.\n- You will also see a health bar at the top of the
    screen when the fight starts.\n\nWhen you are ready step into the yellow light."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
